<view class="page"><member-brand/><view class="compose"><view class="compose-title">告诉 Agent 你的情况与需求</view><view class="muted">说明“我是谁、需要什么、寻找什么人或机会”。私密库和联系方式不会向申请人公开。</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{statement}}" maxlength="1000" placeholder="至少 20 字" bindinput="input"/><view class="compose-actions"><button class="voice" bindtap="record">{{recording?'停止录音':'◉ 语音说明'}}</button><button class="submit" bindtap="submit">提交匹配请求</button></view><view class="voice-hint">{{voiceNotice}}</view></view><view class="notice">AI 初筛与人工确认不可跳过；当前未配置自动 AI 匹配或语音转写。</view><view class="section"><view class="section-title">我的匹配请求</view><view class="row" wx:for="{{requests}}" wx:key="id"><text class="tag tag-green">人工审核中</text><view class="muted">不返回私密匹配结果或联系人</view></view></view><scroll-view class="chips" scroll-x><view class="chip {{active===item.key?'active':''}}" wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="key" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="select">{{item.label}}</view></scroll-view><view class="row" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><text class="tag tag-green">{{item.type}}</text><view class="row-title">{{item.anonymousTitle}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.anonymousSummary}}</view><view class="muted">匿名发布 · 联系方式从不公开</view><button class="button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="apply">申请对接</button></view></view>
